    "created_at": "2023-02-06T18:15:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-06T18:15:52Z",
    "body": "My point is that a subset of custom schemes are basically identical to http/https, but use a different scheme to convey some additional information.  Such a separate processor would have to duplicate a lot of what the Url parser already implements.",
